│   │   ├── header.php       → Reusable header (admin)
│   │   ├── sidebar.php      → Admin-only sidebar
│   │   └── footer.php       → Footer (admin)
│   ├── manage_members.php   → View, edit, promote/demote members
│   ├── manage_events.php    → Add/edit/delete church events
